"synopsis":"Rick Gladiatol became an adventurer at the age of thirty. Now, after two years of training, he's taking the test to advance to E-rank. As the exam begins, he wonders if he's done enough to measure up to all the young people testing alongside him.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yIF9hIOyUr1aOixKqtqHNAzrenN.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 2","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17965","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"163292","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"54913","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"250598","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"433155","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"82165","synopsis":"As Rick awaits his initial exam results, Raster, an examiner for the upcoming section, appears. Rick stops him from hitting on Reanette and earns the examiner's hatred. Raster isn't one to be thwarted, and he isn't called the F-rank Crusher for nothing.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/q91oofZRdbrduGbuNWQNqkd0MDp.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17965","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"163292","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"54913","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"250598","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"433155","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"82784","synopsis":"Rick begins his mock battle with the F-rank Crusher, Raster Diarmut. Raster thinks the gap in ability between him, a genius, and Rick, a late-starting newbie, is all too clear. But as the battle progresses, Rick's training begins to show through.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xFrEQUwaX5Tz0an6DWV5Ofnan7F.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17965","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"163292","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"54913","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"250598","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"433155","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"83208","synopsis":"As Rick waits for his test results, memories flood his mind. As a boy, he'd dreamed of being an adventurer, but the older he got, the more distant the dream became. He set it aside and began work at a Guild. Then, Rick met a certain S-rank adventurer.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fw3bq70Cp3qoEYX5GJTekIx7boF.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17965","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"163292","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"54913","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"250598","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"433155","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"83596","synopsis":"Laurotte asks Rick if he can meet Orichalcum Fist. Rick agrees, but under certain conditions. After warming to Laurotte, Broughston asks him to gather intel to help the party reach their goal. A tip from him sends Rick and the others to a northern town.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aVWQDxGzYuVmQvK69ZzCqGtRk0r.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17965","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"163292","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"54913","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"250598","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"433155","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"84442","synopsis":"Rick and the others head to Heractopia to look for information on the Six Jewels. A parade for an upcoming tournament makes them realize that what they seek might be closer than they think, but there's only one way to know for sure. Enter the tournament!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5UxLCqE5YPYJowpiZVr92139LWM.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17965","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"163292","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"54913","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"250598","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"433155","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"84636","synopsis":"Angelica, Rick, and Broughston all make it through the preliminaries, but the two men do it at an unheard of speed. Rick meets a tournament sponsor who says he's close to Angelica, but when Rick mentions him, Angelica's expression turns dark. (Subs Flix_)","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5yNAIB2gEQLdcDoUnc3PRX5vyLB.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17965","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"163292","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"54913","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"250598","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"433155","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"84763","synopsis":"Angelica tries to run from her brutal training. Rick empathizes and shares something Broughston once told him. After her training, Angelica faces her final block match. Will she break through the qualifiers? The King of Fists Tournament is about to begin.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oCHYNjUi1E17yUFQDoNcWpXr5xV.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17965","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"163292","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"54913","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"250598","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"433155","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"84924","synopsis":"Angelica strikes at Geith using the techniques she's learned in her training. Rick and the others watch closely as she makes use of what they've taught her. Just when it looks like Angelica is about to win, Geith rallies. But Anglica isn't one to give up.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zIZ4LjEmkHro74bIeyI6VNzlOFm.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17965","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"163292","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"54913","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"250598","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"433155","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"85148","synopsis":"The second semi-final match pits Kelvin against Broughston. Kelvin heads out of town to prepare. He spots Rick and presses him for a sparring match. After seeing Rick's skills, Kelvin opens up to Rick about his dreams and what his strength has cost him.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/s8xzLIzqnW5IufJJAku1CcNCICR.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17965","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"163292","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"54913","epi